DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Netherlands: Loonaangifte and payment of loonheffingen (monthly per
 iod)
DESCRIPTION:For monthly aangifte loonheffingen the latest filing and paymen
 t date is the last day of the month after the period (period January 2026:
  28-02-2026\; December 2026: 31-01-2027).\nApplies to: Employers whose aan
 giftetijdvak is a calendar month\nNon-working day: If the date is a Saturd
 ay\, Sunday or public holiday\, payment must arrive before that date.\nSou
 rce for non-working-day rule: https://stichtingenvereniging.belastingdiens
 t.nl/aangifte/aangifte-loonheffingen/loonheffingen-aangeven-en-betalen/\n\
 nSource: https://download.belastingdienst.nl/belastingdienst/docs/tijdvakc
 odes-aangiftedatums-betaaldatums-lh2101t62fd.pdf\nDetails: https://www.int
 elligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#netherlands\n\nFor information only\, no
 t legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the sourc
 e\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 4 October 
 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#netherlands
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nl-loonaangifte-annual@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270131
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=1;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Netherlands: Loonaangifte and payment of loonheffingen (annual peri
 od)
DESCRIPTION:For the annual period (tijdvakcode 6400) the latest filing and 
 payment date is 31 January of the following year (31-01-2027 for 2026).\nA
 pplies to: Employers with a year as aangiftetijdvak\nNon-working day: If t
 he date is a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, payment must arrive bef
 ore that date.\nSource for non-working-day rule: https://stichtingenvereni
 ging.belastingdienst.nl/aangifte/aangifte-loonheffingen/loonheffingen-aang
 even-en-betalen/\n\nSource: https://download.belastingdienst.nl/belastingd
 ienst/docs/tijdvakcodes-aangiftedatums-betaaldatums-lh2101t62fd.pdf\nDetai
 ls: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#netherlands\n\nFor in
 formation only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule 
 stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last
  checked 4 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#netherlands
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
